<title>FINLAND: UPM says has no plan to up loan capital.</title>
<headline>UPM says has no plan to up loan capital.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy said on Thursday it was not about to increase its loan capital and that it had not made any decision on a loan arrangement as reported by business daily Kauppalehti.</p>
</text>
